\section{Stress Test Harness Architecture}

\subsection{Execution Node}
Stress tests are executed on the Autonomous Stress \& Load Testing Harness, which 
implements:
\begin{itemize}
    \item high-frequency tensor evaluation,
    \item random residual perturbation,
    \item cryptographic pipeline saturation,
    \item continuous memory tracking.
\end{itemize}

\subsection{Residual Perturbation Model}
Residual perturbations follow:
\begin{equation}
\delta \mathcal{R}^{\mu\nu} =
\left|
\sin(\alpha) \cdot 10^{-11}
\right|,
\end{equation}
where $\alpha$ is a uniform random variable.

